Views keep: turn gating, `setTimeout` think delay from profile, `eng.launchMarble`, shot-active flags.

#### 3-Cushion planner (simplified v2)

**Routes (no bank shots, no wall-only safety):**

| Priority | Route | Behaviour |
|----------|-------|-----------|
| 1 | `plus1` | Ghost-aim at first object ball when cue carom to second exists |
| 2 | `plus2` | Only when no +1 candidate; 3-cushion mirror from cue |
| 3 | `direct` | Hit nearest object ball (miss) |

**Removed:** `bank`, `wall_only`, cut-angle aim heuristics, safety shots (4-Ball too).

#### 4. 4-Ball planner (`fourBallAi.ts` — simplified)

Ghost-ball / follow / direct second red. Foul avoidance via `opponentLineRisk`. No safety shots.

