### Phase 2 — Scoreboard & HUD panel

**Status:** Not started  
**Scope:** Scoreboard extraction + visual polish + turn/status relocation. **Does not** include tech row (Phase 3), win modal (Phase 4), or game logic changes.

**Goal:** Replace the white score chips floating above the table with one cohesive dark-green HUD panel (nav + scoreboard). Turn/status moves from nav center into the scoreboard. Both game views share components.

#### Current duplication (baseline)

| Piece | `BilliardsView` | `FourBallView` | Notes |
|-------|-----------------|----------------|-------|
| Nav | `GameHudNav` + `center` turn text | same | Turn text to move out of nav |
| Score row | `scoreChip` / `statsChip` (white bg, 8–13px) | `scoreCard` / `midCol` (white bg) | ~90% same layout |
| Win banner | inline gold `winBanner` | inline (bug: win text mixes `playAgain`) | stays inline until Phase 4 |
| Tech row | inline `techRow` 58px | same | **Phase 3 — do not touch** |

Styles to delete after extraction: `scoreRow`, `scoreChip`, `scoreCard`, `activeChip`, `activeCard`, `chipLabel`, `chipScore`, `scoreNum`, `playerLabel`, `statsChip`, `statItem`, `statVal`, `midCol`, `redsLabel`, `redsNum` (per view).

#### Architecture

```
src/components/
  ui/
    GameHudPanel.tsx       — dark wrapper (#1b4332, radii.md, width 95%)
    Scoreboard.tsx         — 3-column row: left slot | center | right slot
    ScoreSlot.tsx          — label + score + active accent bar
    ScoreboardCenter.tsx   — accepts children (game-specific stats)
  gameHud/
    BilliardsScoreboard.tsx  — thin wrapper: props → Scoreboard + 3C center
    FourBallScoreboard.tsx   — thin wrapper: props → Scoreboard + 4B center
```

**Why two game wrappers instead of one giant prop union:** keeps `Scoreboard` dumb/presentational; game views pass only what they have. Optional later: single `GameHud` shell in Phase 3 when tech row joins.

